messages.3093:
We walked through the park without a care in the world;
myself, Kotori who I met by chance, and Kudou who was with
her.

messages.724:
Nakane-sensei's history lecture ended up being random tips
from a grandma's brain. Such as what kind of weeds to eat,
and how to cook them...

messages.1477:
Putting my arms through the sleeves of the school uniform
while fighting off the urge to sleep, I leave the house,
carrying my bag as usual.

messages.1504:
Kotori's very friendly with people, so that role is perfect
for her, and we don't want to give this job to Suginami,
who's not good at human relations.
